---
description: Prepare the {{team.name}} standup from the {{team.queue}} queue.
parameters:
  team: context-types/team.contexttype.tfer
argumentHint: "[since]"
---
Prepare a short standup for the {{team.name}} team: what closed in the
{{team.queue}} queue since the last standup, what is blocked, and who owns
each blocker. Keep it under ten lines.
